librqbit-sha1-wrapper, vendored for Marquee

Upstream: https://github.com/ikatson/rqbit, tag v9.0.1, directory crates/sha1w,
published to crates.io as librqbit-sha1-wrapper 9.0.1. Copyright 2021 Igor
Katson. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0: LICENSE is upstream's
header, LICENSE-APACHE-2.0 the full text. Upstream ships no NOTICE file of its
own.

What was taken: src/lib.rs, README.md and the Cargo.toml published to
crates.io for 9.0.1.

Marquee changes (each changed spot carries a "Marquee fork" comment):

- Cargo.toml: the `sha1-ring` feature depends on `ring` 0.17 instead of
  `aws-lc-rs`.
- src/lib.rs: the `sha1-ring` implementation uses `ring::digest` (SHA-1 and
  SHA-256), whose API aws-lc-rs mirrors. Nothing else changed.

Why: aws-lc added about 1 MB to the Android core with the torrent engine;
ring is already linked for TLS (core backlog C11).
